{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"消防指石鼓洲焚化廠三級火疑涉燒焊或吸煙\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/FIRE-IPARK-261117-17.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】石鼓洲焚化廠上月發生三級火，消防處調查指起火原因可能與燒焊工程或吸煙有關。</p><p>消防處完成現場搜證及向相關人士錄取口供，發現起火地點位於I PARK1焚化爐大樓第三焚化模組的高層位置，調查結果已排除與電力故障、蓄意縱火及化學物質自燃有關。消防處完成報告，並轉交環保署跟進。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T09:31:39.734205+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T08:46:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T11:26:39.379016+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T09:25:08.723892+00:00","content_hash":"f23848ce40c79e0caf95f023d3efc8f9ed7ec06daffd4fe0c9770639169b9ac3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}